data/
# ...except the Oregon business register. It is public record, it is what the
# whole prospect list is built from, and it took a search to find once already.
!data/hoursback/
!data/hoursback/*.csv.gz

# Framework session state — machine bookkeeping, regenerated every session.
# The specs are the exception: they are the written record of what we agreed
# to build, and they belong with the code they describe.
.xf/*
!.xf/specs/

# Scratch: one-off diagnostics, run logs, and safety backups taken before a
# risky change. Useful on the day, meaningless a week later.
tmp-*
scripts/hoursback/tmp-*
MEMORY.md

# Holds a live API key. Never goes through git — keys belong in the
# deployment platform's settings, not in the repository.
.mcp.json

# The status board — one line, rewritten by every run. A board, not a record.
docs/hoursback/last-run.md
